<title>USA: Consep begins 2 mln share public offering.</title>
<headline>Consep begins 2 mln share public offering.</headline>
<dateline>BEND, Ore. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consep Inc said on Thursday it had begun a public offering of 2,000,000 shares.</p>
<p>It said 1,455,563 shares are being sold by the company and 544,437 are being sold by a shareholder.</p>
</text>
